--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream sources
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

XIH-Bench is derived from publicly available research resources. Their own terms
continue to apply to the portions derived from them:

  IFEval       Apache-2.0
               https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/instruction_following_eval
               -> rule-following prompts and verifiers

  TensorTrust  no explicit license file; used with attribution for research
               https://github.com/HumanCompatibleAI/tensor-trust-data
               -> safety access-control attacks

  Belebele     CC BY-SA 4.0
               https://huggingface.co/datasets/facebook/belebele
               -> task-execution passages

  PersonaHub   CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, research use only
               https://huggingface.co/datasets/proj-persona/PersonaHub
               -> persona descriptions (elite_persona split)

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 was chosen as the most permissive license compatible with the
above: PersonaHub's NonCommercial-ShareAlike terms and Belebele's ShareAlike
term both propagate to any derived collection.

IHEval (Zhang et al., NAACL 2025, https://github.com/ytyz1307zzh/IHEval) is the
methodological reference for the instruction-hierarchy setup and evaluator
design. Benchmark items are taken from IFEval and TensorTrust directly.
